Aşağıdaki kodda hangi design pattern kullanılıyor ve bu pattern ne işe yarıyor?

```python
class PaymentGateway(ABC):
    @abstractmethod
    def charge(self, amount, currency, token): ...

class StripeAdapter(PaymentGateway):
    def __init__(self):
        self._stripe = StripeSDK()

    def charge(self, amount, currency, token):
        return self._stripe.create_charge(
            amount_cents=int(amount * 100),
            currency=currency.lower(),
            source=token
        )
```

